OneIsland_House1_Text_HotSpringsOnKindleRoad:
	.string "There's a hot spring along\n"
	.string "KINDLE ROAD.\p"
	.string "A good soak does wonders for these\n"
	.string "old bones, I tell you.$"

OneIsland_House1_Text_GrandsonInHoenn:
	.string "Our grandson moved to HOENN to\n"
	.string "become a POKéMON TRAINER.\p"
	.string "Now that the ferry comes here,\n"
	.string "maybe he'll visit more often.$"
